 for Import Local Handling, as enclosed\\nShould you have any questions or require further clarification, please feel free to contact me. We look forward to the opportunity to support your import logistics requirements.\\n\\nThank you, and we look forward to your feedback.", "location": "Krekot", "visit_type": "discovery", "point_of_meeting": "Introduction MSI"}	\N	73d32d8c-7c7b-4c85-8f8c-99d393ed90e0	2026-07-27 15:05:37.113287+00	2026-07-27 15:05:37.113287+00	\N	\N
