r suitable truck types, depending on cargo volume and delivery requirements.\\n\\n3. Delivery Terms\\nThe required service scope is Door-to-Door.\\nFor certain delivery locations, additional services such as forklift rental and TKBM (stevedoring/labor services) may be required upon request.\\n\\n4. Batam Delivery Process\\nFor shipments to Batam, FCL containers are delivered first to the MAN warehouse.\\nThe cargo is then unpacked and distributed to multiple consignees using CDE, CDD, or other appropriate delivery vehicles.\\n\\n5. Cargo Specification\\nThe average weight of each wooden crate is approximately 600 kg.\\n\\n6. Cargo Insurance\\nDomestic shipments are mandatory to be covered by cargo insurance.\\nThe current logistics provider offers insurance at:\\n0.20% of the Invoice Value, or\\nMinimum premium of IDR 300,000, whichever is applicable.", "location": "Jatiuwung, Tangerang", "visit_type": "discovery", "point_of_meeting": "Introduction about MSI Group "}	\N	73d32d8c-7c7b-4c85-8f8c-99d393ed90e0	2026-07-02 11:22:57.904014+00	2026-07-02 11:22:57.904014+00	\N	\N
