lore opportunities for freight forwarding and specialized cargo handling services.	2026-07-08	{"mom": "Here are point of meeting:\\n1 Monitor the upcoming LCL shipment from ITMIL to Jakarta and identify potential service opportunities \\n2 Review MKE's import requirements, including handling for special (\\"Borongan\\") shipments \\n3 Continue engagement with MKE regarding future freight forwarding opportunities.", "location": "Mastro Building", "visit_type": "discovery", "point_of_meeting": "Participant:\\nIbu Rima - MKE\\nOchi - MSI\\n\\nHere are point of meeting:\\n1 Monitor the upcoming LCL shipment from ITMIL to Jakarta and identify potential service opportunities \\n2 Review MKE's import requirements, including handling for special (\\"Borongan\\") shipments \\n3 Continue engagement with MKE regarding future freight forwarding opportunities.\\n\\nAction needed:\\n1. Ochi will follow up with Ibu Rima regarding the upcoming LCL shipment from ITMIL to Jakarta.\\n2. Further discussions will be arranged to explore opportunities for freight forwarding and specialized cargo handling services."}	\N	73d32d8c-7c7b-4c85-8f8c-99d393ed90e0	2026-06-30 14:14:25.326122+00	2026-06-30 14:14:25.326122+00	\N	\N
